18. attach_task_profile shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha
Preconditions: candidate_created shift_candidate_beta true, vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta true (now true), route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha (init true). Effects: candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha true, not route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha.

19. confirm_candidate_preparedness shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha
Preconditions: candidate_created shift_candidate_beta true, vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta true, candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha true, not candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta (currently false? init has candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha only; shift_candidate_beta not prepared). Effects: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta true.

20. assign_operator_resource shift_candidate_beta driver_operator_alpha
Preconditions: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta true, operator_available driver_operator_alpha (true after step12). Effects: candidate_operator_linked shift_candidate_beta driver_operator_alpha true, not operator_available driver_operator_alpha.

21. assign_skill_certificate shift_candidate_beta skill_certificate_alpha
Preconditions: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta true, skill_certificate_available skill_certificate_alpha (true). Effects: candidate_skill_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta skill_certificate_alpha true, not skill_certificate_available skill_certificate_alpha.

22. assign_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_beta